GUIDE: Then it writes both kinds.

12
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:30,000
DEV: Normal, and edge cases.

13
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,400
GUIDE: Replays every one against mocks.

14
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,500
DEV: No database.

15
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:36,200
GUIDE: And flags exactly what broke.

16
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:38,000
DEV: Before users find it.

17
